[sub_resource type="RoseDialogLine" id="RoseDialogLine_v0pfg"]
text = "Since Golems started to appear in Kenji Beach and the Gorge of Silence, they've taken our territories and killed us without mercy. They refuse to negotiate peacefully with us or consider our proposals to share the land. I was also held hostage by them, but I managed to escape. Now, I've come to Junon Polis seeking help. Will no one save us?"
